{
  "id": 8834339537095,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Player Silhouette Blanket with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-player-silhouette-blanket-with-name-and-number-35f8822fba-35f8822fba",
  "body_html": "<p>Keep your favorite sports enthusiast warm and inspired with this custom basketball blanket from Jeminise. Perfect for basketball lovers, this blanket features a bold dribbling player silhouette and can be personalized with a custom name and number, making it a truly special sports gift for kids, teens, and adults alike.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this blanket with a custom name and number to create a unique and meaningful sports gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Fabric:</strong> Available in both super soft Fleece and warm Sherpa fabric options, crafted with two polyester layers for ultimate comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes Available:</strong> Choose from four sizes to fit your needs: Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Comfort:</strong> Ideal for napping, reading, travel, camping, or lounging on the bed, sofa, or couch during chilly winter nights.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water for simple maintenance; microfiber dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Basketball, Game</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches) | Medium (50x40 inches) | Large (60x50 inches) | X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight, Breathable, Tear Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
